      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Here's an even better example. This avatar's shoulder pads vibrate violently all the time, whereas they used to be perfectly stable and smooth. The effect is very obvious: avtr_2bb7c911-7856-4740-960d-ff22204456a3",
      "viewerReactions": null,
