      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Beta 1780 fixes the collider jitter related issues yay!\n\n**Jitter issues fixed:**\n\n- avtr_2bb7c911-7856-4740-960d-ff22204456a3\n\n- avtr_b504b4b9-db85-467f-bc81-e7a10ede8c8f\n\n- avtr_04a9d322-e228-4934-93b1-6e20b62cfded\n\n**Gravity issues NOT fixed:**\n\n- Gravity causing jitter if physbone component translates at all: avtr_5c972960-700e-41e8-9cb3-136a2c081853 https://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-30/p/physbones-jitter-at-high-movement-speeds-even-if-immobile-is-1\n\n- Gravity (maybe?) intermittently causing physbones to pass through colliders as if they don't exist: avtr_efc7e282-5900-4909-8440-ae27c721757e https://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-30/p/physbone-colliders-randomly-not-working",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
